                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kisha itakuwa, mtakapoongezeka na kuwa wengi katika nchi hiyo, asema BWANA, siku zile hawatasema tena, Sanduku la Agano la BWANA; wala halitaingia moyoni; wala hawatalikumbuka, wala hawatalizuru, wala hayatafanyika hayo tena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
