              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati ule watauita Yerusalemu kiti cha enzi cha BWANA; na mataifa yote yatakusanyika huko Yerusalemu, kwa ajili ya jina la BWANA; wala hawatakwenda tena kwa ukaidi wa moyo wao mbaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
